SUMMARY:Spoooky Movie Night!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nWe will be showing from the fol
 lowing spoooky films:\n\nYoung Frankenstein\nTrailer- [https://www.youtube
 .com/watch?v=sO8g8VmFf0M](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sO8g8VmFf0M)\n\n
 Tucker and Dale vs. Evil\nTrailer- [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l1t8OZ
 n_uhE](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l1t8OZn_uhE)\n\nNightmare Before Ch
 ristmas\nTrailer- [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wr6N_hZyBCk](https://ww
 w.youtube.com/watch?v=wr6N_hZyBCk)\n\nShaun of the Dead\nTrailer- [https:/
 /www.youtube.com/watch?v=LIfcaZ4pC-4](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LIfc
 aZ4pC-4)\n\nVincent Price's The Raven\nTrailer- [https://www.youtube.com/w
 atch?v=PvngX_-K-NI](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PvngX_-K-NI)\n\nVirus\
 nTrailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yb86pjwUv3U\n\nAnd many\, many m
 ore! Bring your own film selections and we may decide to show them!\n\nAdm
 ission is Free! Bring as many family members and friends as you would like
 ! Please RSVP! Discussion after the movie(s)\, hang out and share your tho
 ughts!\n\nSome drinks and snacks will be provided\, please do bring more t
 o share!\nPizza will be ordered\, please do chip in if you partake in deli
 vered food!\n\nSaturday\, October 10th\, 6:00pm - 10:00pm\nOther Room Thea
 ter\n715 N. Pine St.\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nWe can delay starting the movi
 e to give people time to arrive\, but no later than 6:30pm\, please try to
  arrive before then if you do not want to miss any of the movie.\n\nPICTUR
 ED below is the main entrance\, the event space is right up the stairs. On
  street parking should be available\, several public parking lots such as 
 behind CVS are within a 2 blocks walk along Harrisburg Pike.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 316417973/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260904T151208Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260904T151208Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
