SUMMARY:Evening Discussion and Dinner!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nEnjoy dinner and discussion at 
 Indian Curry Lounge with us\, 6:00pm\, Saturday October 24th!\n\nYou may r
 emember this Indian restaurant location was previously known as Namaste\, 
 and before that Tulsi. It is built into the first floor of the motel build
 ing\, it is two doors down from El Serranos\, where we meet for our other 
 monthly evening meeting!\n\nIndian Curry Lounge\n2101 Columbia Avenue\nLan
 caster PA 17603
