SUMMARY:LFS Women’s Gathering
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\n**Join us for the first LFS Wom
 en's Gathering: Lunch at Loxley's!**\nThis is simply a chance for women in
  and around LFS to spend some time together — to meet women we may not k
 now well\, catch up with women we do\, share a meal\, talk\, laugh\, and e
 njoy one another’s company.\nThere’s no business meeting and no requir
 ed agenda. We can talk about whatever interests us: our lives\, ideas\, bo
 oks\, politics\, culture\, what’s happening in Lancaster\, what we’ve 
 been thinking about lately — or anything else that comes up around the t
 able.\nWe’ll also talk a little about whether we’d like to make this a
  regular gathering and\, if so\, what **we** would like it to be.\nFor our
  first get-together\, we’re meeting at Loxley’s — an especially fun 
 place to begin\, with its Robin Hood and Sherwood Forest theme.\nAnd since
  every good Sherwood Forest gathering needs her:\n**Maid Marian is welcome
  at our table.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 316738916/
